/--
lemma `Rel'.symm` / 引理 `Rel'.symm`

English:
lemma Rel'.symm
  given: {x y : X₁ oplus X₂} (h : Rel' f g x y)
  proof: by
  obtain _ | ⟨_, _, h⟩ | _ | _ := h
  · apply Rel'.refl
  · exact Rel'.inl_inl _ _ h.symm
  · exact Rel'.inr_inl _
  · exact Rel'.inl_inr _

中文:
引理 关系'.symm
